monoid elements: ('1', (0, 0), (0, 1), (1, 0), (1, 1))
associativity checked on 125 triples
equal-product quadruples checked: 145
every quadruple has a left/right Levi factor
The monoid is equidivisible, but B(M) is S^2 (Fiedorowicz2002).
Therefore equidivisibility alone cannot imply asphericity.
